## E1 unmount without disposeOwned()
   × unmounting disposes the owned drawing handles and the fortune objects; a remount draws again

## E2 swap site names in duplicate refusal
   × two coinciding sites are refused with a message naming both, in Slovenian and English; the drawing is removed and the step clamped

## E3 recreate sweep handle per sync
   × board object count is unchanged after 20 step changes
   × dragging a site recomputes the trace, keeps the step index and the object count

## U3 announce on every render (no drag guard)
   × the live region exists while empty, and does not change during the frames of a drag

